Unstructured (SE) grid IC files can be regridded horizontally and vertically with ncremap, 
which is part of NCO: https://nco.sourceforge.net/nco.html#ncremap

To regrid only vertically:
ncremap --vrt_out=/glade/campaign/acom/MUSICA/grids/templates/template_L58.nc in_file_L93.nc out_file_L58.nc


To regrid from ne30 to a regionally refined grid, use something like:

srcgrid=ne30pg3
dstgrid=GEMSne30x8

srcgridfile=/glade/campaign/acom/MUSICA/grids/ne30np4/ne30np4_091226_pentagons.nc
dstgridfile=/glade/campaign/acom/MUSICA/grids/GEMSne30x8/GEMS01_ne30x8_np4_SCRIP.nc

infile=/glade/campaign/acom/acom-weather/emmons/ic_files/f.e3b08.FHISTC_LTt1s.camsm11_finn26.2023.merra2.ne30.01.cam.i.2023-12-01-00000.nc
outfile=/glade/campaign/acom/acom-weather/emmons/GEMS01_ne30x8/ic/ic_f.e3b08.FHISTC_LTt1s.camsm11_finn26.GEMSne30x8_2023-12-01_c${datestr}.nc

wghtfile=map_${srcgrid}_to_${dstgrid}_blin_c${datestr}.nc
ESMF_RegridWeightGen --ignore_unmapped -m bilinear -w ${wghtfile} -s ${srcgridfile} -d ${dstgridfile}

ncremap -m ${wghtfile} -i ${infile} -o ${outfile}
